                     <textLang xml:lang="ar">Arabic</textLang>
                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s18IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>يَعْتَذِرُوْنَ إِلَيْكُمْ إِذَا رَجَعْتُمْ إِلَيْهِمْ قُلْ لَّا تَعْتَذِرُوْا لَنْ نُّؤْمِنَ لَكُمْ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#19v">-19v</locus>وَّأتَّبِعْ مَا يُوْحَآ إِلَيْكَ وَاصْبِرْ حَتَّي يَحْكُمَ اللهُ وَهْوَ خَيْرُ الْحَاكِمِيْنَ<note>the manuscript ends with surat 10, Yūnis. Guz' 11 goes up to surat 11, Hud, v.5.</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>Beginning of the ǧuzʾ ornated (f.1v). Surat Yūnis (f.7r), and formulas of tawḥīd (f.7r, 17v) rubricated. Words left incomplete, rewritten in full on the following line on almost all folios. Some words left incomplete, completed on the following line. Deletions (ff.1v, 5v, 6v, 18r, 19r). Many folios were repaired recently by mounting a strip of white paper on their edges and on the internal margin, preventing access to potential marginal content. No (visible) catchwords.</note>
                     <note/>
